32: \r\n333:   - Name: RomM\r\n334:   - Path: F:\\GitHub\\RomM\r\n335:   - Primary: False\r\n336:   - Data Directory: F:\\GitHub\\RomM\r\n337:   - Todo Path: docs/todo.yaml\r\n338: \r\n339: \r\n340:   ## Authentication\r\n341: \r\n342:   All /mcpserver/* endpoints require a per-workspace auth token:\r\n343:   - Header: X-Api-Key: KjssYiuYMVh5f0Q32Gi8_W3jQ6vGVN_RoCoWc9rUgJ8\r\n344:   - Or query param: ?api_key=KjssYiuYMVh5f0Q32Gi8_W3jQ6vGVN_RoCoWc9rUgJ8\r\n345:   If you receive a 401, re-read this marker file ΓÇö the token rotates on each server restart.\r\n346: \r\n347:   ## Where Things Live\r\n348: \r\n349:   - AGENTS.md ΓÇö agent conduct, requirements tracking, session continuity, glossary\r\n350:   - .github/copilot-instructions.md ΓÇö build/test commands, architecture, coding conventions\r\n351:   - docs/context/ ΓÇö on-demand reference (schemas, module docs, compliance rules, action types)\r\n352:   - docs/Project/ ΓÇö requirements docs, TODO.yaml, mapping matrices\r\n353:   - templates/ ΓÇö prompt templates\r\n354: \r\n355:   ## Context Loading by Task Type\r\n356: \r\n357:   - Session logging ΓåÆ docs/context/session-log-schema.md + docs/context/module-bootstrap.md (pull module-bootstrap via MCP context)\r\n358:   - TODO management ΓåÆ docs/context/todo-schema.md + docs/context/module-bootstrap.md (pull module-bootstrap via MCP context)\r\n359:   - API integration ΓåÆ docs/context/api-capabilities.md (or GET http://PAYTON-LEGION2:7147/swagger/v1/swagger.json)\r\n360:   - Adding dependencies ΓåÆ docs/context/compliance-rules.md\r\n361:   - Logging actions ΓåÆ docs/context/action-types.md\r\n362: \r\n363:   ## Protocols\r\n364: \r\n365:   - REST API: http://PAYTON-LEGION2:7147/mcpserver/* (requires X-Api-Key). Use this for typed client/API integration and read-only diagnosis after the required plugin/tool route fails. Do not bypass the required plugin for session log, TODO, requirements, import/export, or traceability operations. Swagger UI: http://PAYTON-LEGI