{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"mcpserver","tool":"requirements_effective","arguments":{"workspacePath":"F:\\GitHub\\RomM","productScope":"local"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"currentLayer\":{\"key\":\"layer-1\",\"order\":1,\"name\":\"Layer 1\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"createdAtUtc\":\"2026-07-14T22:34:45.7800806+00:00\",\"updatedAtUtc\":\"2026-07-14T22:34:45.7800806+00:00\"},\"functional\":[{\"id\":\"FR-AUTH-001\",\"title\":\"Client API token and Basic auth\",\"body\":\"RomM.Client shall authenticate with a Client API Token (Bearer rmm_...) or HTTP Basic. Tokens must not appear in query strings. Credentials must only be sent to the configured BaseAddress host; absolute URLs on other hosts must not receive Authorization.\\n\\nAcceptance:\\n1. ClientApiToken attaches Authorization Bearer with the token value.\\n2. Basic attaches Authorization Basic with base64 username:password.\\n3. Cross-host absolute URLs do not receive the configured Bearer or Basic header.\\n4. Missing/invalid credentials on the configured host yield 401 mapped to RomMAuthException.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-AUTH-002\",\"title\":\"OAuth password grant and refresh\",\"body\":\"OAuth password grant stores access/refresh tokens. expires and refresh_expires are relative TTLs in seconds. Refresh occurs within 30s of expiry. Concurrent grants share one token request. Failed refresh clears the store. Token POST targets BaseAddress /api/token, not a foreign host.\\n\\nAcceptance:\\n1. Grant stores access token and uses Bearer on subsequent calls.\\n2. Near-expiry refresh uses refresh_token and updates the store.\\n3. Concurrent requests share one grant.\\n4. Rejected refresh clears the token store.\\n5. OAuth does not POST username/password to a non-BaseAddress host.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-CSDB-001\",\"title\":\"Search CSDb for SID demos and cracks\",\"body\":\"Users must be able to search the Commodore Scene Database (CSDb) for SID music, demos, and cracks via a service integrated with the RomM stack (companion/sidecar API and/or UI). Search must cover free-text queries and support filtering by kind (sid, demo, crack). Results must be returned to the caller as a structured list (CSDb id, title, type, kind).\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-CSDB-002\",\"title\":\"Selective CSDb ingest to library storage\",\"body\":\"When a user requests ingest of explicitly selected CSDb entries (ids and kinds), each selected item must be downloaded or linked into RomM Structure A storage under the built-in c64 platform path library/roms/c64/ (preferred), using package folders or flat files tagged (csdb-{id}). Maximum 20 items per request. Deduplicate by CSDb id; skip existing packages unless force is set. Archives must be extracted into the package folder; archive files must not be retained. Do not auto-download entire unbounded search result sets. Temporary staging folders c64-csdb-* are allowed only if config.yml remaps them to c64; end state is direct write under roms/c64/.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-CSDB-003\",\"title\":\"Link CSDb SID results to HVSC or roms\",\"body\":\"For CSDb SID results, resolve HVSCPath from the CSDb webservice when present and hardlink or symlink into roms/c64/ (Structure A, built-in c64 slug) from the host HVSC tree bind-mounted at /romm/library/hvsc (host ./hvsc, not image-baked) when the file exists; otherwise download from CSDb when a file URL is available. Name files with (csdb-{id}) tags so GameBase and CSDb SID references remain joinable. Do not treat HVSC as a RomM platform folder under roms/.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-CSDB-004\",\"title\":\"FR-CSDB-004\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link FR-CSDB-004.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-CSDB-005\",\"title\":\"FR-CSDB-005\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link FR-CSDB-005.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-CSDB-006\",\"title\":\"FR-CSDB-006\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link FR-CSDB-006.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-CSDB-007\",\"title\":\"FR-CSDB-007\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link FR-CSDB-007.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-CSDB-008\",\"title\":\"FR-CSDB-008\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link FR-CSDB-008.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-DX-001\",\"title\":\"FR-DX-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link FR-DX-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-GB64-001\",\"title\":\"GameBase64 source tree and Structure A landing\",\"body\":\"GB64 remains host-sourced under ./gb64 (Games ZIPs, Screenshots, ROMs). C64 game media is imported only under runtime/library/roms/c64/. Letter buckets (a1, b2, 0) are never RomM platform or parent folders. gb64/ROMs firmware is not auto-imported into roms/ (optional library/bios is a separate root).\\n\\nAcceptance:\\n1. Import output is under roms/c64/ only.\\n2. No letter-bucket directory is created as a RomM parent.\\n3. Missing gb64/Games causes prepare to SKIP game import with a log line.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-GB64-002\",\"title\":\"Screenshot staging into library/screenshots\",\"body\":\"NFO Screenshot: values are GB64-relative (A\\\\Alfabug.png). Prepare shall robocopy gb64/Screenshots into runtime/library/screenshots when the library screenshot tree is empty (or ForceLibraryBuild), then write marker .screenshots-synced.\\n\\nAcceptance:\\n1. After sync, Screenshot: A\\\\file.png resolves to library/screenshots/A/file.png.\\n2. Existing screenshot library data skips sync unless Force.\\n3. Missing gb64/Screenshots logs SKIP and does not throw.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-GB64-003\",\"title\":\"VERSION.NFO tagging and extract\",\"body\":\"tools/Gb64Import shall unzip each GB64 game ZIP, parse VERSION.NFO, and name output from NFO Name (sanitized) plus RomM tags per docs/gb64-romm-tag-mapping.md: language, PAL/NTSC, revision, (gb64-id), TrueDrive when NFO says Yes. Multi-file media becomes a folder; single media a file. VERSION.NFO is not left in the scannable ROM tree.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-GB64-004\",\"title\":\"Conditional import, resume, force, and markers\",\"body\":\"Prepare runs Gb64Import only when C64 library media is missing (no media files and no .gb64-library-built). Importer persists .gb64-import-state.txt. ForceLibraryBuild rewrites state and re-imports. Success requires the game marker file.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-GB64-005\",\"title\":\"SID NFO fixer against HVSC\",\"body\":\"Gb64Import --fix-sids indexes HVSC basenames and rewrites VERSION.NFO SID: fields: keep if resolvable; remap if the SID exists under a different HVSC-relative path; set SID: (None) if unresolvable.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-GB64-006\",\"title\":\"Asset path validation\",\"body\":\"Gb64Import --validate-assets checks that each NFO Screenshot: and SID: relative path resolves under attached library/screenshots and library/hvsc and reports ok/missing counts.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-HVSC-001\",\"title\":\"HVSC lives on attached library storage\",\"body\":\"The High Voltage SID Collection (HVSC) shall live on the host under runtime/library/hvsc (container /romm/library/hvsc). Layout includes MUSICIANS/, GAMES/, DEMOS/. HVSC is gitignored, not a RomM platform under roms/, and not baked into Docker image layers.\\n\\nAcceptance:\\n1. Compose bind makes HVSC visible at /romm/library/hvsc.\\n2. Dockerfile does not COPY or RUN an HVSC fetch into the image.\\n3. SID: MUSICIANS\\\\W\\\\Whittaker_David\\\\180.sid resolves under that root.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-HVSC-002\",\"title\":\"HVSC download and normalize\",\"body\":\"Operators fetch HVSC with scripts/Download-Hvsc.ps1 which runs tools/HvscFetch (C#, no Python). Default dest is runtime/library/hvsc. Discovers archive URL or HVSC_URL, extracts, and normalizes MUSICIANS/GAMES/DEMOS at dest root.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-HVSC-003\",\"title\":\"Prepare does not download HVSC\",\"body\":\"Prepare-RomMLibrary.ps1 shall not download HVSC. If library/hvsc lacks MUSICIANS or any .sid, it logs WARN and the Download-Hvsc command line.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-MCP-TRIAGE-002\",\"title\":\"FR-MCP-TRIAGE-002\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link FR-MCP-TRIAGE-002.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-PLT-001\",\"title\":\"Platforms list and get\",\"body\":\"GET /api/platforms and GET /api/platforms/{id} return id and slug/fs_slug. Required Commodore slugs include c64, c128, c-plus-4, vic-20 when those libraries exist.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROM-001\",\"title\":\"ROM list query\",\"body\":\"GET /api/roms supports search_term, platform_ids, limit, offset, order_by, order_dir. Response includes items, total, limit, offset.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROM-002\",\"title\":\"ROM pagination enumerate\",\"body\":\"EnumerateAsync pages until offset\\u002Bcount \\u003E= total or a short page. Missing total must not stop after the first full page. Cancellation must not yield further items.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROM-003\",\"title\":\"ROM detail\",\"body\":\"GET /api/roms/{id} returns detailed metadata. Unknown id maps to 404.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROM-004\",\"title\":\"ROM content download\",\"body\":\"GET /api/roms/{id}/content/{file_name} streams bytes with ResponseHeadersRead.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-001\",\"title\":\"Use RomM Structure A and built-in Commodore platforms\",\"body\":\"The stack must treat upstream RomM as the library authority. Storage follows RomM Structure A: library/roms/{platform}/. Commodore 8-bit libraries that operators must support as first-class platform roots use RomM built-in folder slugs only: c64 (Commodore C64/128/MAX), c128 (Commodore 128), c-plus-4 (Commodore Plus/4), vic-20 (Commodore VIC-20). Also recognize other built-in Commodore slugs when present (c16, cpet, commodore-cdtv) without inventing alternate folder names. Empty platform folders created by RomM on first run are expected and must be host-persisted under runtime/library/roms/. Custom side folders (if any) must remap via config.yml system.platforms to one of these built-in slugs or be retired.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-002\",\"title\":\"Maintain c64, c128, Plus/4, and VIC-20 libraries\",\"body\":\"The operator library must include distinct Structure A trees for at least four Commodore platforms, using exact RomM slugs: roms/c64/, roms/c128/, roms/c-plus-4/, and roms/vic-20/. Each tree is a separate RomM platform for scan, metadata, and UI. Content must be placed in the platform that matches the software (do not dump VIC-20 or Plus/4 titles into c64). Host paths under runtime/library/roms/{slug}/ must exist and be bind-mounted so libraries survive container recreate. Optional additional platforms (c16, cpet, commodore-cdtv) follow the same pattern when content is added.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-003\",\"title\":\"Preserve RomM config and conditional GB64 library prepare on redeploy\",\"body\":\"Redeploy shall preserve .env, runtime/config/config.yml, runtime/assets, runtime/library, runtime/csdb, host HVSC, and gb64. Prepare-RomMLibrary.ps1 never overwrites a non-empty config.yml. GB64 game import and screenshot sync run only when the corresponding attached library data is missing, unless ForceLibraryBuild.\\n\\nAcceptance:\\n1. Existing non-empty config.yml is byte-identical after redeploy.\\n2. Populated roms/c64 or marker .gb64-library-built skips game import.\\n3. Empty roms/c64 plus gb64/Games runs Gb64Import.\\n4. Populated library/screenshots or marker .screenshots-synced skips screenshot robocopy.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-004\",\"title\":\"HVSC and screenshots on attached library for metadata paths\",\"body\":\"GB64 VERSION.NFO SID: and Screenshot: fields store relative paths only. At runtime those paths must resolve against roots on host-attached library storage mounted into the container: HVSC under library/hvsc (SID: MUSICIANS\\\\... -\\u003E library/hvsc/MUSICIANS/...), screenshots under library/screenshots (Screenshot: A\\\\file.png -\\u003E library/screenshots/A/file.png). Both roots must sit under the Structure A library parent (runtime/library on host, /romm/library in container) so they survive container recreate and are visible to RomM and csdb-bridge without baking into the image. Source ./gb64 may remain import-only; resolvable screenshot files must be staged into library/screenshots. HVSC is downloaded into library/hvsc, not only a path outside the library mount.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-005\",\"title\":\"REST heartbeat and authentication\",\"body\":\"The RomM HTTP API on port 8080 exposes GET /api/heartbeat and accepts Authorization: Bearer (client token rmm_...) or the documented OAuth/password flow. Tokens must not appear in URL query strings. Unauthenticated protected routes return 401.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-006\",\"title\":\"Platforms API\",\"body\":\"GET /api/platforms lists platforms with numeric id and slug. GET /api/platforms/{id} returns one platform. Slugs include c64, c128, c-plus-4, vic-20 when those libraries exist.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-007\",\"title\":\"ROM list, search, page, and char index\",\"body\":\"GET /api/roms supports search_term, platform_ids, limit, offset, order_by, order_dir. Page payload includes items, total, offset, and a character index for A-Z jump.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-008\",\"title\":\"ROM detail\",\"body\":\"GET /api/roms/{id} returns detailed ROM metadata including files (fs_name), cover fields, and summary. Unknown id returns 404.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-009\",\"title\":\"ROM content download\",\"body\":\"Authenticated download of a ROM file by id and file name streams bytes. Missing file returns 404.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-010\",\"title\":\"Library scan task\",\"body\":\"The server exposes a tasks API so a client can trigger a library scan after ingest and poll status until complete.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-011\",\"title\":\"Collections (lists)\",\"body\":\"The server persists user collections: list, create, rename, delete, add roms, remove roms. Smart/virtual collections are read-only.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-ROMM-012\",\"title\":\"Cover art fetch\",\"body\":\"Cover images are fetchable. Public url_cover may be unauthenticated. Server path_cover_* resources require Bearer. Missing artwork does not 500 the ROM list.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-SPEC-001\",\"title\":\"FR-SPEC-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link FR-SPEC-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-SYS-001\",\"title\":\"Heartbeat SYSTEM contract\",\"body\":\"GET /api/heartbeat deserializes RomM 5.0.0 HeartbeatResponse with SYSTEM.VERSION and SYSTEM.SHOW_SETUP_WIZARD. A top-level VERSION fixture is not the live contract.\\n\\nAcceptance:\\n1. SYSTEM-wrapped JSON populates Version and ShowSetupWizard.\\n2. Top-level-only VERSION does not populate Version as the live contract.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-TASK-001\",\"title\":\"Task list and run\",\"body\":\"GET /api/tasks returns TaskInfo with name/title. POST /api/tasks/run/{task_name} returns task_id and status per OpenAPI TaskExecutionResponse.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"FR-TASK-002\",\"title\":\"Task status JobStatus\",\"body\":\"GET /api/tasks/{task_id} uses JobStatus. finished is terminal success. failed/stopped/canceled are terminal failure.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"}],\"technical\":[{\"id\":\"TR-AUTH-001\",\"title\":\"TR-AUTH-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-AUTH-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-CI-001\",\"title\":\"TR-CI-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-CI-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-CSDB-001\",\"title\":\"TR-CSDB-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-CSDB-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-CSDB-002\",\"title\":\"TR-CSDB-002\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-CSDB-002.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-CSDB-ARCH-001\",\"title\":\"CSDb bridge sidecar service (C#)\",\"body\":\"Implement integration as companion service csdb-bridge in C# ASP.NET Core (.NET 8), not a RomM core fork and not Python. Share Structure A library storage with RomM: LIBRARY_ROMS_ROOT maps to host runtime/library/roms (containing c64/ and any other platform dirs). Expose REST for full-catalog search (source=live), RSS recent-window index, and selective ingest by explicit id list. Rate limits and search caps apply. HVSC_ROOT is the host HVSC bind, not under roms/.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-CSDB-CLIENT-001\",\"title\":\"CSDb search and webservice clients\",\"body\":\"Search free-text via CSDb site search HTML (or advanced search) filtered for demos, cracks, and SIDs. Resolve metadata and DownloadLinks via https://csdb.dk/webservice/?type=release|sid\\u0026id={id}\\u0026depth=2. Do not assume a free-text webservice search exists. Parse DownloadLink Link URLs for file retrieval.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-CSDB-INGEST-001\",\"title\":\"Selective ingest pipeline with archive extract\",\"body\":\"POST /csdb/v1/ingest accepts 1..20 explicit {kind, csdb_id} items. For each item: fetch webservice detail, download Ok links or HVSC-link SIDs from HVSC_ROOT (/romm/library/hvsc from host ./hvsc), write under LIBRARY_ROMS_ROOT/c64/ (Structure A). If a download is an archive (zip/7z/rar by extension or magic), extract into the package folder and do not keep the archive. Rate-limit CSDb HTTP. Persist job manifest under csdb data root. Optional RomM scan trigger when ROMM_API_TOKEN is configured.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-CSDB-LAYOUT-001\",\"title\":\"CSDb ingest paths under roms\",\"body\":\"Preferred write targets for C64 scene content: roms/c64/{Name} (csdb-{id})/ or flat roms/c64/{Name} (csdb-{id}).{ext}. Tags: (csdb-{id}) plus optional (Demo)/(Crack). Never create letter-bucket parents. Never invent non-RomM platform slugs for C64. If legacy staging paths roms/c64-csdb-demo|crack|sid|misc are used during transition, config.yml must remap each to c64. SIDs prefer hardlink/copy from HVSC_ROOT into roms/c64/, not into a separate sid platform.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-ERR-001\",\"title\":\"TR-ERR-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-ERR-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-GB64-IMPORT-001\",\"title\":\"C# Gb64Import\",\"body\":\"Game import is tools/Gb64Import (.NET), invoked by prepare via dotnet run. No Python.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-GB64-SIDFIX-001\",\"title\":\"SID field repair\",\"body\":\"SidNfoFixer builds an HVSC basename index and rewrites NFO SID: inside GB64 ZIPs (remap or (None)).\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-GB64-STATE-001\",\"title\":\"Import resume and markers\",\"body\":\"Importer state file .gb64-import-state.txt under roms/c64. Prepare game marker .gb64-library-built. Screenshot marker .screenshots-synced.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-GB64-TAG-001\",\"title\":\"Tag mapping from VERSION.NFO\",\"body\":\"Filename tags follow docs/gb64-romm-tag-mapping.md and RomTagBuilder: (gb64-{id}), (rev-NN), language, PAL/NTSC, TrueDrive.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-GB64-VALID-001\",\"title\":\"Asset path validator\",\"body\":\"AssetPathValidator applies the same relative-path rules as Resolve-SidPath.ps1 and Resolve-ScreenshotPath.ps1.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-GEN-001\",\"title\":\"TR-GEN-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-GEN-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-HTTP-001\",\"title\":\"TR-HTTP-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-HTTP-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-HVSC-FETCH-001\",\"title\":\"HvscFetch normalize\",\"body\":\"HvscFetch uses the HVSC version API unless HVSC_URL is set, extracts with SharpCompress, and flattens MUSICIANS/GAMES/DEMOS at dest root.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-HVSC-HOST-001\",\"title\":\"Host HVSC download and compose mounts\",\"body\":\"Provide C# tools/HvscFetch and scripts/Download-Hvsc.ps1 writing by default to runtime/library/hvsc (attached library root). docker-compose mounts ./runtime/library to /romm/library so HVSC is at /romm/library/hvsc. Dockerfile does not bake HVSC. Document in docs/hvsc-in-container.md. NFO SID: paths resolve against HVSC_ROOT only when this tree is on the bind-mounted library storage.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-LIB-001\",\"title\":\"TR-LIB-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-LIB-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-MCP-TRIAGE-004\",\"title\":\"TR-MCP-TRIAGE-004\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-MCP-TRIAGE-004.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-PKG-001\",\"title\":\"TR-PKG-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-PKG-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-PROC-001\",\"title\":\"TR-PROC-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-PROC-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-ROMM-API-001\",\"title\":\"Pinned REST surface\",\"body\":\"Server HTTP is RomM 5.x compatible with openapi/romm-5.0.0.json. Required paths: /api/heartbeat, /api/platforms, /api/roms, content download, tasks/scan, collections.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-ROMM-AUTH-001\",\"title\":\"Bearer and 401\",\"body\":\"Protected /api routes require Authorization: Bearer. Client tokens use the rmm_ prefix. Tokens never appear in query strings. 401 on missing or invalid credentials.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-ROMM-CFG-001\",\"title\":\"config.yml platform remaps only when needed\",\"body\":\"RomM /romm/config/config.yml may define system.platforms remaps. If temporary CSDb staging folders (c64-csdb-demo|crack|sid|misc) remain, each must remap to c64 so the UI shows one C64 platform. Preferred end state: no staging folders; ingest and GB64 organization write under roms/c64/ with (csdb-{id}) or (gb64-{id}) tags. config.yml must not redefine built-in Commodore platform identities.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-ROMM-COLL-001\",\"title\":\"Collections REST\",\"body\":\"Collections use /api/collections with scopes collections.read and collections.write. Mutating a smart/virtual collection is rejected.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-ROMM-DEPLOY-001\",\"title\":\"Deploy preserve-and-prepare script behavior\",\"body\":\"Deploy process stashes and restores .env, runtime/config, runtime/library, runtime/assets, runtime/csdb, hvsc, gb64 around git checkout/clean. Invokes scripts/Prepare-RomMLibrary.ps1 which creates required platform dirs and runs GB64 library build only when roms/c64 lacks game media and no .gb64-library-built marker (unless Force). Never overwrites non-empty config.yml.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-ROMM-MEDIA-001\",\"title\":\"Compose and env roots for library media\",\"body\":\"docker-compose mounts ./runtime/library to /romm/library (and to csdb-bridge /data/library). Set HVSC_ROOT=/romm/library/hvsc and SCREENSHOTS_ROOT=/romm/library/screenshots on romm; csdb-bridge uses /data/library/hvsc and /data/library/screenshots. Download-Hvsc.ps1 default dest is runtime/library/hvsc. Prepare-RomMLibrary ensures library/hvsc and library/screenshots dirs, syncs gb64/Screenshots to library/screenshots when screenshots library data is missing, and does not place HVSC under roms/.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-ROMM-PLAT-001\",\"title\":\"Ensure required Commodore platform directories on host\",\"body\":\"On deploy and local compose prepare, ensure directories exist: runtime/library/roms/c64, runtime/library/roms/c128, runtime/library/roms/c-plus-4, runtime/library/roms/vic-20. Document exact RomM slugs (hyphenated: c-plus-4, vic-20; not plus4 or vic20). Do not rename to non-RomM aliases. Scripts or deploy steps may mkdir -p these paths; content may be empty until filled.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-ROMM-STRUCT-001\",\"title\":\"Structure A paths and native platform slugs\",\"body\":\"Compose and bridge paths must align with Structure A library/roms/{platform}. Required host platform directories (created if missing): c64, c128, c-plus-4, vic-20. Optional: c16, cpet, commodore-cdtv. Mount host runtime/library/roms to /romm/library/roms on RomM so all platform trees persist. CSDb bridge LIBRARY_ROMS_ROOT maps to the same host roms tree; C64 scene ingest defaults to roms/c64/. HVSC is not a platform folder: bind ./hvsc to /romm/library/hvsc (sibling of roms/). Do not use subpath-only mounts that omit the required platform roots.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-TFM-001\",\"title\":\"TR-TFM-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-TFM-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TR-WF-001\",\"title\":\"TR-WF-001\",\"body\":\"Placeholder requirement backfilled for TODO link TR-WF-001.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"}],\"testing\":[{\"id\":\"TEST-AUTH\",\"condition\":\"RomMAuthHandlerTests: Bearer, Basic, OAuth grant/refresh/concurrent/clear, no credentials on cross-host absolute URLs. RomMHttpExceptionMappingTests: 401 -\\u003E RomMAuthException.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-CSDB-001\",\"condition\":\"Unit tests with fixtures: HTML search pages yield release/SID ids and types; release XML yields DownloadLinks; sid XML yields HVSCPath; Type/kind maps to writes under roms/c64/ (or a path remapped to c64), never letter buckets.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-CSDB-002\",\"condition\":\"Given an ingest request with N explicit items (1\\u003C=N\\u003C=20), the job attempts download/link for all N and records each outcome. Partial failures do not drop unprocessed ids silently. Archives are extracted into the package folder without retaining the archive file.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-CSDB-003\",\"condition\":\"Integration test with mocked downloads writes files or hardlinks under roms/c64/ with (csdb-{id}) naming and multi-file folders when multiple DownloadLinks exist. SID hardlinks resolve from a fixture HVSC tree into roms/c64/.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-GB64-001\",\"condition\":\"Mapping rules and any organizer tooling place extracted GameBase packages under roms/c64 with (gb64-{id}) tags and never under letter-bucket parents. NFO SID: paths resolve under host ./hvsc; Screenshot: under ./gb64/Screenshots.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-GB64-002\",\"condition\":\"Screenshot sync skip/run via Prepare-RomMLibrary and .screenshots-synced marker.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-GB64-003\",\"condition\":\"NfoAndTagTests parse NFO and assert RomM tags including (gb64-26153).\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-GB64-004\",\"condition\":\"Conditional import skip/run/resume/force via .gb64-library-built and .gb64-import-state.txt.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-GB64-005\",\"condition\":\"SID NFO fixer remaps or clears SID: against HVSC; dry-run does not modify ZIPs.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-GB64-006\",\"condition\":\"--validate-assets counts ShotOk/ShotMissing and SidOk/SidMissing.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-HVSC-001\",\"condition\":\"Given ./hvsc contains MUSICIANS (or a fixture SID path), scripts/Resolve-SidPath.ps1 resolves NFO SID: paths under that root. docker-compose.yml declares ./hvsc bind mounts for romm and csdb-bridge. Dockerfile must not COPY or RUN HVSC fetch into the image.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-HVSC-002\",\"condition\":\"Download-Hvsc.ps1 / HvscFetch produce runtime/library/hvsc/MUSICIANS.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-HVSC-003\",\"condition\":\"Prepare with empty library/hvsc logs WARN and does not throw solely for missing HVSC.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-PLT\",\"condition\":\"RomMCoreClientTests Platforms List and Get return id and fs_slug.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-ROM\",\"condition\":\"RomMCoreClientTests and RomListQueryTests: list query, enumerate full total, cancel, download path.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-ROMM-001\",\"condition\":\"On a running RomM stack with host roms mount, /romm/library/roms contains at least c64, c128, c-plus-4, and vic-20 directories (empty allowed). Host runtime/library/roms mirrors those slugs. GB64 C64 media and CSDb C64 ingest resolve under roms/c64/ (or a folder remapped to c64). HVSC is at /romm/library/hvsc, not under roms/. No docs or compose use non-RomM aliases (plus4, vic20) as folder names.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-ROMM-002\",\"condition\":\"Given compose up with runtime/library/roms mounted, verify host and container both list directories c64, c128, c-plus-4, vic-20 under library/roms. Creating a probe file under host roms/vic-20/ is visible in the container at /romm/library/roms/vic-20/ (bind persistence).\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-ROMM-003\",\"condition\":\"Given existing non-empty runtime/config/config.yml and populated roms/c64, a redeploy leaves config.yml byte-identical and does not re-run GB64 library import (Prepare-RomMLibrary reports SKIP). Given empty roms/c64 and present gb64/Games, prepare reports RUN library build and creates marker or content.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-ROMM-004\",\"condition\":\"Given HVSC under runtime/library/hvsc and a fixture SID path, Resolve-SidPath finds the file. Given screenshots under runtime/library/screenshots with Letter/file.png layout, Resolve-ScreenshotPath finds NFO Screenshot paths. Compose defines a single library bind including both roots. Paths are not only under unmounted ./gb64 or image layers.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-ROMM-005\",\"condition\":\"REST contract: heartbeat, platforms, roms list/detail, download, scan. Covered in tests/RomM.Client.Tests.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-ROMM-006\",\"condition\":\"Collections list/create/add/remove; smart collections read-only.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-SYS\",\"condition\":\"RomMCoreClientTests heartbeat SYSTEM wrapper populates Version; top-level-only VERSION is not the live contract.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"},{\"id\":\"TEST-TASK\",\"condition\":\"RomMCoreClientTests: TaskExecutionResponse task_id; TaskStatusResponse finished is success.\",\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\",\"title\":\"\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"scopeStartLayerKey\":\"layer-1\"}],\"mappings\":[{\"frId\":\"FR-AUTH-001\",\"trIds\":[\"TR-ROMM-AUTH-001\"],\"testIds\":[\"TEST-AUTH\"],\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\"},{\"frId\":\"FR-AUTH-002\",\"trIds\":[\"TR-ROMM-AUTH-001\"],\"testIds\":[\"TEST-AUTH\"],\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\"},{\"frId\":\"FR-CSDB-001\",\"trIds\":[\"TR-CSDB-ARCH-001\",\"TR-CSDB-CLIENT-001\"],\"testIds\":[\"TEST-CSDB-001\"],\"workspaceId\":\"F:\\\\GitHub\\\\RomM\"},{\"frId\":\"FR-CSDB-002\",\"trIds\":[\"TR-CSDB-ARCH-001\",\"TR-CSDB-CLIENT-001\",\"TR-CSDB-INGEST-001\",\"TR-CSDB-LAYOUT-001\",\"TR-ROMM-CFG-001\",\"TR-ROMM-STRUCT-001\"],\"testIds\":[\"TEST-CSDB-002\",\"TEST-CSDB-003\",\"TEST-RO